<template>
<AppShell active="profile" :before-leave="beforeLeave"><view class="page-heading"><h1>{{root?'管理员':'我的'}}</h1></view>
<view class="profile-identity"><view class="profile-avatar"><AppIcon :name="root?'shield':'user'"/></view><view><h2>{{root?'管理员':store.activeAccount?.alias||store.user?.name||'我的账号'}}</h2><text class="muted">{{root?'root':store.user?.student_id}}</text></view><text class="pill" :class="store.activeAccount?'green':''">{{root?'本机管理':store.activeAccount?'凭据已保存':'待保存账号'}}</text></view>
<view v-if="message" class="notice" :class="error?'error':'success'" role="status">{{message}}</view>
<view v-if="managedAccount" class="notice" role="status">{{credentialSyncMessage}}</view>
<view class="profile-list"><template v-if="!root"><button class="setting-row" :disabled="busy" @click="openName"><AppIcon name="user"/><text>姓名或备注</text><span class="setting-value">{{store.activeAccount?.alias||'未设置'}}</span><AppIcon name="chevron-right"/></button><button class="setting-row" :disabled="busy||!store.activeAccount" @click="check"><AppIcon name="check-circle"/><text>{{busy?'正在验证…':'检查学校登录'}}</text><AppIcon class="at-end" name="chevron-right"/></button><button class="setting-row" :disabled="busy||!store.activeAccount" @click="password='';modal='password'"><AppIcon name="lock"/><text>更新已保存密码</text><AppIcon class="at-end" name="chevron-right"/></button><view class="verified-at">上次学校验证 {{formatTime(store.activeAccount?.verified_at)}}</view></template>
<template v-else><button class="setting-row" @click="go('/pages/index/index')"><AppIcon name="file-text"/><text>全部执行历史</text><AppIcon class="at-end" name="chevron-right"/></button><button class="setting-row" @click="go('/pages/account_info/account_info?new_account=1')"><AppIcon name="plus"/><text>新增学校账号</text><AppIcon class="at-end" name="chevron-right"/></button><button class="setting-row" @click="go('/pages/admin/admin')"><AppIcon name="home"/><text>运行看板</text><AppIcon class="at-end" name="chevron-right"/></button><button class="setting-row" @click="go('/pages/admin/admin?tab=users')"><AppIcon name="users"/><text>用户管理</text><AppIcon class="at-end" name="chevron-right"/></button><button class="setting-row" @click="go('/pages/admin/admin?tab=audit')"><AppIcon name="file-text"/><text>管理记录</text><AppIcon class="at-end" name="chevron-right"/></button><view class="admin-status"><SchedulerStatus :status="store.status"/><p class="hint">提交并发上限 {{store.status.capacity||'—'}} · 管理员功能仅本机开放</p></view></template>
<button class="setting-row" :aria-pressed="reduced" @click="setMotion(!reduced)"><AppIcon name="sliders"/><text>减少动态效果</text><span class="setting-value">{{reduced?'已开启':'跟随系统'}}</span></button><button class="setting-row" @click="modal='help'"><AppIcon name="help-circle"/><text>使用帮助</text><AppIcon class="at-end" name="chevron-right"/></button></view>
<NotificationSettings v-if="store.activeAccount" ref="notificationRef" :account-id="store.activeAccountId" :session-key="String(store.sessionEpoch)" :offline="store.user?.auth_mode==='offline'" :disabled="busy"/>
<view v-if="root" class="mail-admin-status"><button class="text-button" @click="loadMailStatus">检查邮件服务</button><p v-if="mailStatus" class="hint">{{mailStatus.configured?'发件服务已配置':'发件服务尚未配置'}}{{mailStatus.error?' · 邮件服务需检查':''}}</p><p v-if="mailError" class="notice error">{{mailError}}</p></view>
<MacPowerPanel v-if="root" role="root" :data="powerData" :error="powerError" :busy="powerBusy" @refresh="loadPower" @update="changePower" @install="installPower"/>
<button class="button ghost logout-button" :disabled="busy" @click="logout">退出登录</button><p class="hint">退出不会关闭已开启计划，也不会取消学校预约。</p>
<AppDialog :open="modal==='name'" title="姓名或备注" :busy="busy" @close="close"><label class="muted" for="profile-name">显示名称</label><input id="profile-name" aria-label="显示名称" class="input" style="margin-top:12px" v-model="name" :disabled="busy" maxlength="80" placeholder="姓名或备注" @confirm="saveAccount(false)"/><p class="hint">保存时验证学校身份。</p><view v-if="message" class="notice" :class="error?'error':'success'">{{message}}</view><template #footer><button class="button secondary" :disabled="busy" @click="close">取消</button><button class="button" :disabled="busy||!name.trim()" @click="saveAccount(false)">{{busy?'保存中…':'验证并保存'}}</button></template></AppDialog>
<AppDialog :open="modal==='password'" title="更新已保存密码" :busy="busy" @close="close"><p class="hint">填写当前学校密码，仅更新主后台保存的密码。密码变化后需要重新登录。</p><p v-if="managedAccount" class="notice">双机凭据不会自动同步。密码实际变化后，请联系管理员同步两台执行电脑及托管登记；完成前该账号无法定时执行。</p><view class="field" style="margin-top:24px"><label>学校密码</label><input class="input" v-model="password" password :disabled="busy" placeholder="请输入当前学校密码" @confirm="saveAccount(true)"/></view><view v-if="message" class="notice" :class="error?'error':'success'">{{message}}</view><template #footer><button class="button secondary" :disabled="busy" @click="close">取消</button><button class="button" :disabled="busy||!password" @click="saveAccount(true)">{{busy?'验证中…':'验证并更新'}}</button></template></AppDialog>
<AppDialog :open="modal==='help'" title="使用帮助" @close="close"><view class="help-sections"><details open><summary>如何开启自动预约</summary><p>在预约计划选择首选和备选座位、使用时段，再点击“保存并开启定时”。仅保存不会自动开启。默认每天07:00提交次日预约。</p></details><details><summary>周五与自定义时间</summary><p>周五最晚20:00结束。自定义时段截短后仍需至少2小时，全天按学校规则自动适配。</p></details><details><summary>当天预约</summary><p>当天手动预约先预检，再核对摘要并确认真实提交。与定时计划独立；结果不确定时先查学校记录，不重复提交。</p></details><details><summary>执行电脑需要在线吗</summary><p>放号时执行电脑需已唤醒并连接校园网。关闭网页不停止后台；睡过执行窗口不会补交。</p></details><details><summary>如何判断是否成功</summary><p>以学校有效预约回执为准；保存计划、等待执行、提交中及待核对均不等于成功。</p></details><a v-if="store.policy?.source_url" :href="store.policy.source_url" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">学校官方使用帮助 ↗</a></view></AppDialog>
</AppShell>
</template>
<script setup>
import {ref,computed,onMounted,onBeforeUnmount,watch} from 'vue';import {onShow,onHide} from '@dcloudio/uni-app';import {useWorkspace} from '@/stores/workspace.js';import * as api from '@/services/local_api.js';
import AppShell from '@/components/AppShell.vue';import AppIcon from '@/components/AppIcon.vue';import AppDialog from '@/components/AppDialog.vue';import SchedulerStatus from '@/components/SchedulerStatus.vue';
import MacPowerPanel from '@/components/MacPowerPanel.vue';
import NotificationSettings from '@/components/NotificationSettings.vue';
const store=useWorkspace(),root=computed(()=>store.user?.role==='root'),modal=ref(''),name=ref(''),password=ref(''),busy=ref(false),message=ref(''),error=ref(false),reduced=ref(false);let generation=0;
const managedAccount=computed(()=>store.activeAccount?.capabilities?.execution_mode==='dual_node');
const credentialSyncMessage=computed(()=>store.activeAccount?.capabilities?.credential_sync_state==='maintenance_required'?'双机凭据待维护，请联系管理员同步两台执行电脑及托管登记。':store.activeAccount?.capabilities?.credential_sync_state==='matched'?'凭据版本与托管登记一致；两台电脑是否可执行仍以放号前检查为准。':'双机凭据同步状态尚未确认，请联系管理员核对。');
const notificationRef=ref(null),mailStatus=ref(null),mailError=ref('');
async function loadMailStatus(){try{mailStatus.value=await api.getMailStatus();mailError.value='';}catch(e){mailError.value=e.message;}}
const profileVisible=ref(false),powerData=ref(null),powerError=ref(''),powerBusy=ref(false);let powerGeneration=0,powerTimer=null;
async function loadPower(){if(!root.value||!profileVisible.value||powerBusy.value)return;const ticket=++powerGeneration,epoch=store.sessionEpoch;try{const result=await api.getMacPower();if(ticket===powerGeneration&&epoch===store.sessionEpoch&&root.value){powerData.value=result;powerError.value='';}}catch(e){if(ticket===powerGeneration&&epoch===store.sessionEpoch)powerError.value=e.message;}}
async function powerAction(action){if(!root.value||powerBusy.value)return;const ticket=++powerGeneration,epoch=store.sessionEpoch;powerBusy.value=true;try{const result=await action();if(ticket===powerGeneration&&epoch===store.sessionEpoch&&root.value){powerData.value=result;powerError.value='';}}catch(e){if(ticket===powerGeneration&&epoch===store.sessionEpoch)powerError.value=e.message;}finally{if(ticket===powerGeneration)powerBusy.value=false;}}
const changePower=changes=>powerAction(()=>api.updateMacPower({...changes,expected_revision:powerData.value?.config.revision}));
const installPower=()=>powerAction(api.installMacPower);
watch([root,profileVisible,()=>store.sessionEpoch],()=>{clearInterval(powerTimer);powerGeneration++;powerBusy.value=false;powerData.value=null;powerError.value='';if(root.value&&profileVisible.value){loadPower();powerTimer=setInterval(loadPower,10000);}});
onShow(()=>{profileVisible.value=true;});onHide(()=>{profileVisible.value=false;});onBeforeUnmount(()=>{clearInterval(powerTimer);powerGeneration++;});
const formatTime=v=>v?v.replace('T',' ').slice(0,19):'暂无记录';
function openName(){name.value=store.activeAccount?.alias||'';message.value='';modal.value='name';}
async function close(){if(busy.value)return;if(!await beforeLeave())return;modal.value='';password.value='';message.value='';}
async function beforeLeave(){if(busy.value)return false;if(notificationRef.value?.beforeLeave&&!await notificationRef.value.beforeLeave())return false;const dirty=modal.value==='password'&&password.value||modal.value==='name'&&name.value!==(store.activeAccount?.alias||'');if(!dirty)return true;return new Promise(resolve=>uni.showModal({title:'有未保存的修改',content:'是否放弃当前编辑？',cancelText:'继续编辑',confirmText:'放弃修改',success:r=>resolve(r.confirm)}));}
async function go(url){if(await beforeLeave())uni.reLaunch({url});}
async function check(){if(busy.value||!store.activeAccount)return;const token=++generation,epoch=store.sessionEpoch,id=store.activeAccountId;busy.value=true;message.value='';try{await api.checkAccount(id);if(token!==generation||epoch!==store.sessionEpoch)return;await store.refresh();if(token!==generation||epoch!==store.sessionEpoch||id!==store.activeAccountId)return;message.value='学校登录验证正常。';error.value=false;}catch(e){if(token===generation&&epoch===store.sessionEpoch){message.value=e.message;error.value=true;}}finally{if(token===generation)busy.value=false;}}
async function saveAccount(changePassword){
  if(busy.value||!store.activeAccount||changePassword&&!password.value)return;
  const token=++generation,epoch=store.sessionEpoch,a=store.activeAccount,managed=managedAccount.value;
  if(changePassword&&managed){const accepted=await new Promise(resolve=>uni.showModal({title:'更新双机账号密码',content:'如果学校密码已变化，本次仅更新主后台。两台执行电脑及托管登记需管理员另行同步；完成前该账号无法定时执行。是否继续？',success:r=>resolve(r.confirm)}));if(!accepted||token!==generation||epoch!==store.sessionEpoch||a.id!==store.activeAccountId)return;}
  busy.value=true;message.value='';
  try{
    const result=await api.verifyAccount({student_id:a.student_id,password:changePassword?password.value:'',alias:changePassword?a.alias:name.value.trim(),expected_revision:a.revision});
    if(token!==generation||epoch!==store.sessionEpoch)return;password.value='';
    if(changePassword&&a.credential_revision!=null&&result.account?.credential_revision!==a.credential_revision){
      await store.logout(managed?'密码已在主后台保存，请使用当前学校密码重新登录；双机凭据仍需管理员同步，完成前该账号无法定时执行。':'密码已保存，请使用当前学校密码重新登录。');uni.reLaunch({url:'/pages/login/login'});return;
    }
    await store.refresh();if(token!==generation||epoch!==store.sessionEpoch||a.id!==store.activeAccountId)return;modal.value='';message.value=changePassword?'学校身份已核实，已保存当前凭据。':'名称已保存。';error.value=false;
  }catch(e){if(token===generation&&epoch===store.sessionEpoch){message.value=e.message;error.value=true;}}
  finally{if(token===generation){password.value='';busy.value=false;}}
}
async function logout(){if(!await beforeLeave())return;const confirmed=await new Promise(resolve=>uni.showModal({title:'退出登录？',content:'已开启的计划继续由后台执行，不会取消学校预约。',success:r=>resolve(r.confirm)}));if(!confirmed)return;busy.value=true;try{await store.logout();uni.reLaunch({url:'/pages/login/login'});}catch(e){message.value=e.message;error.value=true;}finally{busy.value=false;}}
function setMotion(value){reduced.value=value;if(typeof document!=='undefined')document.documentElement.dataset.motion=value?'reduce':'';try{localStorage.setItem('njfu-reduced-motion',value?'1':'0');}catch{}}
onMounted(()=>{try{reduced.value=localStorage.getItem('njfu-reduced-motion')==='1';}catch{}});
onShow(async()=>{const token=++generation,epoch=store.sessionEpoch;try{await store.refresh();}catch(e){if(token===generation&&epoch===store.sessionEpoch){message.value=e.message;error.value=true;}}});onHide(()=>{generation++;busy.value=false;password.value='';modal.value='';});
</script>
<style scoped>
.profile-identity{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;padding:12px 0 36px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:12px}.profile-avatar{width:60px;height:60px;background:var(--tint);border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none}.profile-avatar :deep(.app-icon){width:28px;height:28px}.profile-identity>view:nth-child(2){flex:1;min-width:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.profile-identity h2{margin-bottom:7px}.profile-list{max-width:840px}.setting-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;width:100%;min-height:82px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);text-align:left;padding:20px 0;font-size:16px}.setting-value,.at-end{margin-left:auto}.setting-value{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);text-align:right;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.verified-at{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;padding:16px 0}.logout-button{margin-top:36px;min-width:220px}.admin-status{padding-top:24px}.help-sections details{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:18px 0}.help-sections summary{font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;min-height:36px}.help-sections p{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.9;margin:12px 0}.help-sections>a{display:block;margin-top:28px;font-size:14px}@media(max-width:599px){.profile-identity{gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding-bottom:24px}.profile-identity .pill{margin-left:74px}.setting-row{gap:14px;min-height:76px}.logout-button{width:100%}.setting-value{max-width:46%}}
</style>
